{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116056","id":3260269417,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7CU8Np","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116056","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116056.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116056.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116056","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116056/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116056/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116056/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6622ac7cf0ae11c69c73a45daaaf30128659c105","number":116056,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix 2D glow artifacts on Forward+ renderer (regression from 4.5) (fixes #116053)","user":{"login":"jayvenn21","id":53269831,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMjY5ODMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53269831?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21","html_url":"https://github.com/jayvenn21","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Description\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes a rendering regression in Godot 4.6 where enabling 2D glow on the Forward+ renderer produces moving white line artifacts on the left side of the viewport.\r\n\r\nThe issue:\r\n- Appears only on **Forward+**\r\n- Does **not** reproduce on the Mobile renderer\r\n- Does **not** reproduce in Godot 4.5\r\n- Is visible even in the editor and reacts to editor UI redraws\r\n- Has been observed on Intel Iris Xe (D3D12)\r\n\r\nThis strongly suggests stale or uninitialized glow buffer data being reused between frames in the 2D canvas path.\r\n\r\n### Fix\r\n\r\nThe fix ensures the 2D glow buffer is properly cleared / initialized before use when running on the Forward+ renderer, preventing residual data from previous frames or editor redraws from leaking into the output.\r\n\r\n### Reproduction\r\n\r\n1. Godot 4.6 (Forward+, D3D12)\r\n2. Node2D root\r\n3. ColorRect covering screen\r\n4. WorldEnvironment with Canvas background and glow enabled\r\n5. Observe white line artifacts on the left side of the screen\r\n6. Move mouse over editor panels — artifacts update in real time\r\n\r\n### Result\r\n\r\nArtifacts are no longer visible when using 2D glow on Forward+.\r\n\r\n### Related issue\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","description":"","color":"E94A26","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-02-08T19:15:47Z","updated_at":"2026-02-09T11:21:58Z","closed_at":"2026-02-08T20:28:12Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"b600feb6843d81c9c5e70e6f7c9907df35bc89d6","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"jayvenn21